{"title":"64","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sixty-four</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sixty-three&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sixty-three (page does not exist)\">sixty-three</a> and preceding <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sixty-five&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sixty-five (page does not exist)\">sixty-five</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=64&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Properties\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sixty-four is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_square\" title=\"Perfect square\">square</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_cube\" title=\"Perfect cube\">cube</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and also the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91d92ded08453fe4662a56223d382b4cba6aa35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />.</li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=64&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017130008\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0